  "description": "CentralWatch distributed tracing (Tempo). Lists recent and slow traces, AWS spans (S3/SNS/SQS/DynamoDB/Lambda) and business workflow spans (User Registration, User Login, Order Creation, Notification Workflow, Image Processing Workflow, Retry Operation, Retry Attempt N) for service centralwatch-demo-app. Click any table row to load the trace into the Trace Waterfall (fills the $traceId variable).",
